# The era each Origins entry belongs to, by Puranic tradition (Vishnu Purana I.7-15; Bhagavata III-IV, VIII).
# Daksha's daughters wed Kashyapa when Daksha is reborn in Chakshusha's era, so Kashyapa's line belongs to Vaivasvata's.

